agg for Debian
--------------

Package agg contains a subset of the files under the directory agg-2.4
in the subversion repository at https://svn.code.sf.net/p/agg/svn/
Revision r128 is currently used for package agg.

Removal of gpc
--------------
Upstream agg comes with gpc, the General Polygon Clipper library. gpc
has a non-free license that allows non-commercial use only. Commercial
users must pay for a commercial license. So it is removed from the
Debian package. Files removed:
  gpc/VERSIONS.TXT
  gpc/copying.txt
  gpc/gpc.c
  gpc/gpc.h
  include/agg_conv_gpc.h

Files remaining:
  gpc/Makefile.am

Other source files removed
--------------------------
Upstream agg contains several directories that are not relevant to libagg
under Debian: agg2d, bin, and myapp. These have been removed.

